DESCRIPTION >
    Regression scenario for the "unspecified JSON key becomes an empty-string
    default instead of staying absent" symptom reported by CollegeVine
    (workspace agent_reporting) on tb 4.6.14: a row whose JSON column never
    supplied a given key started rendering that key back with a "" default
    once another row in the same column supplied it, changing toString()
    output and any equality/blank-filter assertion against it.

SCHEMA >
    `row_id` String `json:$.row_id`,
    `params_json` JSON `json:$.params_json`

ENGINE "MergeTree"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "row_id"
